@Vaesen.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5230

GET {{Vaesen.Api_HostAddress}}/health

###

### Create an account (open in Development)
POST {{Vaesen.Api_HostAddress}}/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "Ingrid",
  "email": "ingrid@example.com",
  "auth0UserId": null
}

### Get an account by username
GET {{Vaesen.Api_HostAddress}}/api/accounts/by-username/Ingrid

### Readiness (includes DynamoDB)
GET {{Vaesen.Api_HostAddress}}/health/ready

### Create a guild (the founder becomes its first member). Use an account id from "Create an account".
POST {{Vaesen.Api_HostAddress}}/api/guilds
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "The Society of Upsala",
  "createdByAccountId": "account-00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### Get a guild (members, characters, who plays what)
GET {{Vaesen.Api_HostAddress}}/api/guilds/by-name/The Society of Upsala

### Create a character in the guild
POST {{Vaesen.Api_HostAddress}}/api/guilds/guild-00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/characters
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Astrid",
  "lastName": "Falk",
  "class": "Occultist",
  "healthPoints": 100,
  "createdByAccountId": "account-00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### Let a member play a character
PUT {{Vaesen.Api_HostAddress}}/api/guilds/guild-00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/characters/character-00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/player
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "account-00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### Get a character by name
GET {{Vaesen.Api_HostAddress}}/api/characters/by-name/Astrid Falk

### Change a character (fields left out stay as they are; a new first/last name renames it; "" clears the class)
PATCH {{Vaesen.Api_HostAddress}}/api/characters/character-00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "class": "Doctor",
  "healthPoints": 80
}

### Delete a character (leaves its guild, its player stops, the name becomes free)
DELETE {{Vaesen.Api_HostAddress}}/api/characters/character-00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### The classes a character can have
GET {{Vaesen.Api_HostAddress}}/api/characters/classes

### Dev login as a real account playing one of its guild's characters (assign the character first)
POST {{Vaesen.Api_HostAddress}}/api/dev/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "account-00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "characterId": "character-00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}
